window.products.push({"id":1037278,"name":"Single Serve Coffee Maker, with Reusable Ground Basket and Pod Holder, Easy to Use and Clean, One Cup Coffee Maker with Bold Brew, Descaling Reminder,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tsNX1-UQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 in 1 Coffee Maker with \"Bold\" Setting - This 2 in 1 ground and pod coffee maker gives you two options to choose from when making that fresh, smooth cup of coffee you need to kick-start your day. Select between the regular coffee setting or the bold setting. The bold setting allows more flavor to be extracted from the beans, resulting in a stronger, richer coffee. One-button Easy Operation - Brewing a cup of hot coffee just push one button. This single serve coffee maker is very easy to use, and you only need a simple operation to have a smooth cup of coffee on a busy morning. The one cup coffee maker is easy to clean, just add descaling agent and press two function keys simultaneously to activate self-cleaning function. Fast Brewed - Whether you're at home or in the office, brew your 6oz cup of coffee in just 3 minutes with this single coffee maker. Coffee comes out as hot as 185°F, which is the ideal temperature for drinking hot coffee with added cream or milk. If you want to take your coffee to go, you can use the travel mug instead of the regular coffee mug because the small coffee makers can also fit a 6.7\" tall travel mug. Enjoy delicious coffee everywhere and in all times. Compact Coffee Maker that Fits Any Small Space - This mini coffee maker can be used any small space, such as kitchen, living room and RV. The compact size makes the coffee machine easy to carry, so you can take it with you when camping and traveling. Large Brewing Ground Basket - Features a larger brew basket than the conventional coffee machine. The large capacity 25g (0.9oz) ground coffee basket of this single cup coffee maker allows you to brew stronger coffee without limitations and can also be used to brew tea. The reusable ground basket lets you brew ground coffee instead of paying for expensive K-cups and you don't have to worry about the amount of waste they generate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tsNX1-UQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tastyle","source_asin":"B0B2W9Y4JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2W9Y4JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2W9Y4JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
