window.products.push({"id":1037283,"name":"Bar Stool Set of 2 Velvet Adjustable with Tufted Backrest, Counter Height Swivel Stool Upholstered Modern Barstool Chair Chrome Base for Kitchen, Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UO1Yj9VKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy and Durable Velvet Bar Stool: This swivel bar stools are made of heavy-duty chrome. This padded bar stool with a large base will provide more stability and balance. This sturdy base attaches with a rubber ring to prevent the floor from scratching. A metal pedestal comes with a slender footrest to offer a comfortable sitting position. Bar Stool with Comfortable Backrest: The velvet bar stool comes with an upholstered high back with button-tufted detail. When you sit on the soft velvet bar stool, your back and waist will feel extra comfortable and relaxed. The nailhead trim surrounding the seat and back adds an elegant and decorative touch to this kitchen barstool. Height Adjustable Swivel Bar Stool: This upholstered bar stool can be adjusted from 39.7inch to 48.0inch. It is suitable for most of different height bars. You can adjust the height by raising the lever under the seat. The lifting mechanism works perfectly. The swivel bar stool can be 360° rotated. So, you can easily get access to your items or chat with people around without moving. Modern Kitchen Bar Stool Chair: This bar stool is constructed with high density padded foam and finely upholstered velvet fabric with easy care. Luxury velvet bar stool with studded details. Multi-function Velvet Swivel Bar Stool: This modern and stylish bar stool is suitable for many occasions. Our cushioned bar stools are suitable for many places, such as dining room, kitchen island, balcony, resting room, living room, coffee bar, restaurant and so on. Modern Bar Stool Set of 2: This kitchen bar stool chair will bring elegance and stylish into your home with a timeless and contemporary appearance that easily blends into any décor. Dimension: stool size: 23.1inch*39.7-48inch*21.3inch. Seat height: 24.8-33.1inch. Base diameter: 16.1inch. This counter height bar chair can hold up to 300lbs maximum capacity. Assembly and Customer Service: Easy assembly which makes you laborsaving. If you have any issue, please contact us at any time and we will try our best to help you within 24*7 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UO1Yj9VKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HedoAjim","source_asin":"B0B6FYWWVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6FYWWVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6FYWWVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
