window.products.push({"id":1037372,"name":"1-2 Year Old Dwarf Red Navel (Cara Cara) Orange Tree in Grower's Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318FA-1aZaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Red Navel (Cara Cara navel) orange treats you to a unique pink fleshed orange with true navel orange taste, fruit that is sweet and juicy.Red Navel Oranges work great as a patio plant. If you live in a cold climate, just bring it inside during the winter. They produce abundantly indoors or out. Just place it in front of a sunny window and pick fresh fruit throughout the winter. Red Navels grow and produce fruit for many years but may remain at a height of only 4 to 6 feet even after several years in a container. Enjoy the aroma of the blossoms as well. The scent will fill the air with an inviting, refreshing smell. About Fruit Production: Due to the blossoming cycles of Citrus & Fruit Trees we cannot guarantee that any of our trees will arrive with developed fruit on them. Since our trees are grown from grafts of mature trees, they do produce fruit years sooner than a seeded tree would. Usually our trees will begin to blossom and produce fruit around two to three years old. The older a tree is, the more likely it is to produce fruit. Fruit production is seriously effected by the care that the tree receives and also the climate that the tree resides in. With proper care, any of our trees will thrive and produce fruit for many years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318FA-1aZaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lemon Citrus Tree","source_asin":"B0064OY1WO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0064OY1WO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0064OY1WO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
