window.products.push({"id":1037437,"name":"Qucover Sea Turtle Comforter Set Queen 3-Piece Soft Tencel Cotton 3D Blue Ocean Comforter, Teen Kids Comforter Bedding Set with 2 Pillowcase, Queen 90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aYMBIFAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Queen Size Comforter Set includes 1 comforter 90\" x 90\", and 2 Pillow Cases 19\" x 29\". 🔔 The bedding set is Vacuum Packed, it may be some wrinkles when come out of the bag, recommend to wash or put it in the sun and tap gently for fluffy. Good Material: The comforter is made of Tencel Cotton Fabric. It is different with Polyester, and it is environmental material and has soft character as cotton, also absorb sweat and no shrink. Marine Themed: Vivid 3D Blue Ocean Theme Pattern, sean turtle, and coral pattern which shows sea beauty and express freedom. Uniform suture, solid and durable. Wonderful Bedding: Perfect for families with pets or children. Decorate your bedroom, guest room, Coastal villas and hotels with this blue comforters. Light enough to carry when you travel or go for outside activities. A good gift for teen, boys, girls, etc. Care Instruction: Machine wash gentle cycle with cold water, Sun dry or low tumble dry on low heat. Do not iron. Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aYMBIFAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qucover","source_asin":"B0BG51GKZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG51GKZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG51GKZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037438,"name":"Rachael Ray Classic Brights Hard Enamel Nonstick 8.5-Inch Skillet, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmQmXpxzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One of the most used pans in any well-equipped kitchen. Skillets have sloped sides so that foods slide out easily. Used for cooking omelets, pancakes, quesadillas, sauteing vegetables, searing steaks, fish and poultry. The nonstick surface makes cleanup effortless. Stylish two-tone gradient exterior adds color and style to any kitchen. Plus this cookware heats quickly and evenly, reducing \"hot spots\" that can burn foods. Long-lasting nonstick interior allows food to slide off and makes cleanup quick and easy. The rubberized dual-riveted handle is comfortable and oven safe to 350-degree F. Limited Lifetime Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmQmXpxzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B008PRHXKA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008PRHXKA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008PRHXKA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037439,"name":"Painted Sea Turtles Blacklight Poster - Flocked - 23\" x 35\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sQ09Hi4DL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Painted Sea Turtles Blacklight Poster , 23 inches x 35 inches, standard sized. This poster image features multi-color sea turtles swimming under water. The turtles really pop under blacklight.Printed in the USA with highly fluorescent inks and black flocking. Blacklight posters make great decoration for bedrooms, college dorm rooms, parties, entertainment rooms, or wherever you need a splash of color or glow.A flocked poster has black fibers that feel felt-like. The black appears much darker than an ink with no glare and gives great contrast to the fluorescent UV reactive inks. The poster has a 3/4 inch (1.9 cm white border around the whole poster, which is normal for screen printed blacklight posters. The posters get pulled through the printing press by this border and the area cannot be printed.Blacklight not included and is required to see the poster fluoresce or glow in the dark. Image under blacklight is for reference only, results may vary depending on type of blacklight (ultraviolet fixture or bulb) used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sQ09Hi4DL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scorpio Posters","source_asin":"B081S954RC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081S954RC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081S954RC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037440,"name":"eoocvt 10pcs Hepa Filter Replacement Compatible For irobot Roomba 800 900 series 870 880 980 Robotic Vacuum Parts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCYeADz8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fully Compatible with: Compatible For iRobot Roomba 800Compatible For iRobot Roomba 870Compatible For iRobot Roomba 880Compatible For iRobot Roomba 980 the AeroForce Filters trap dust and dirt  Item Size: 54mm*110mm*10mm (2.1in*4.3in*0.4in) How to intall the replacement Compatible For iRobot Roomba filters: 1.Press the bin release tab to remove the bin; 2.Open the filter compartment door; 3.Remove the filter by pulling upwards on the yellow tab; 4.Install a new filter; * Match the filter corner to slide track ** Push in filter presence indicator to re-insert filter 5.Close the filter compartment door; 6.Re-insert the bin. How to clean the filters: 1.Remove the vacuum bin, and then press and lift the filter door release tab. Remove filter by grasping the yellow tab; 2. Shake off debris by tapping the filter against your trash container.  Kit include: Replacement Compatible For iRobot Roomba filter * 10 Kindly Note: This is not a Compatible For iRobot Roomba OEM product and is not covered under any Irobot Roomba manufacturer's warranty. The Compatible For Irobot Roomba brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Compatible For Irobot Roomba brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NCYeADz8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eoocvt","source_asin":"B01M4HA8AM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M4HA8AM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M4HA8AM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037441,"name":"Nomad Platform Bed Furniture Mission King Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":773.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xs5JCGBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mission Style Platform Bed This Headboard gives you a classic and strong design Standard Mission Frame comes with 3.25\" wide side rails. The Frame stands 12” from floor to top of bed slats Slat Set is made from durable, unfinished & un-sanded, Furniture Grade Poplar Wood Standard Slats are 2” wide and spaced 3.2” apart Standard Headboard fits 7-9\" mattress Depth measurement from the top of Slats to top of side rail is 1.75\" IMPORTANT NOTE: All frames are Finished with Danish Oil. To Assemble Your New Platform Bed Your new platform bed frame is delivered straight to your door ready for assembly. The headboard is not pre-assembled. For this Mission Style Bed we recommend having two people available. After all an extra set of hands is always helpful. A #2 Phillips Screw Driver and a rubber mallet OR regular hammer are tools you will need. The bed is constructed with shoulder screws. For a snug fit, the side rails and headboard are tapped lightly into place. You are provided a wood tapping block to use with your hammer so you don't mar the wood. You will have written directions to follow in your package. Do familiarize yourself with all the parts by first laying out all the pieces, then follow the step-by-step basic assembly instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xs5JCGBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOMAD","source_asin":"B00N6GCI28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N6GCI28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N6GCI28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
