window.products.push({"id":1037463,"name":"LifeStartsNow Garlic Rocker Crusher Mincer Press Plastic Dishwasher Safe with BONUS Food Grade Silicone Peeler (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dz5VBBnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hi, LifeStartsNow Kitchen here! So just a quick tip and a few pointers to help you with your new Garlic Crusher: For larger cloves I apply pressure to \"break\" the clove & make it easier to rock (thus the double-handed tiptoe press vs. rocking for this action). If I want a more \"minced\" consistency vs. \"chopped\", I scrape the garlic from the rocker & rock one more time. I use a spoon to remove the garlic from the rocker as seen in the picture. Some may be left in the holes, but running water from the back & running through the dishwasher gets most of the garlic from holes (perfection is hard to attain). Also, for anyone who has rheumatoid arthritis which makes it very difficult to squeeze a normal garlic press together enough to mince anything, this rocker would be a pain saver for sure! I would definitely recommend this to anyone who has issues with their hands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dz5VBBnZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeStartsNow","source_asin":"B07BDRBPKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BDRBPKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BDRBPKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037464,"name":"Medium Binchotan Charcoal from Kishu, Japan - Water Purifying Stick for Great-Tasting Water, 1 Stick - Filters up to 2 Liters of Water","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rj3yo5mJL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Binchotan (Japanese Oak) activated charcoal is the highest grade of charcoal. These charcoals are from the Kishu region of Japan. Binchotan charcoal has been used for centuries for its excellent purification properties in reducing water hardness, absorbing odor, and filtering for a pure fresh taste. Filtering time for 2L of water is 3-4 hours. Use 1 stick for 2 liters of water; stick is approximately 0.8\" in diameter and 5.9\" in length. Reactivate charcoal every two weeks by boiling for 10 minutes and letting dry. Do not use with water that is microbiologically unsafe or of unknown quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rj3yo5mJL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPPINKA","source_asin":"B0774FZZBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0774FZZBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0774FZZBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
