window.products.push({"id":1037586,"name":"GHP Brown Sturdy Ergonomic Seating Massage Recliner Sofa Chair Lounge Heated w Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LyQofTJlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This is our Deluxe Ergonomic Massage Recliner Sofa Chair, which is of ergonomically designed with 8 vibrating massage nodes. The massage nodes, which all have a heating option, are sure to offer you the finest relaxation and comfort for your back, lumbar and legs. What’s more, it is simple and smart design provide you with practicality and beauty. More remarkable, the high-quality sponge pad the backrest, seat and armrests. There are also two cup holders for you to enjoy a drink when relaxing on it. Ideal for stiff Muscle relax, pain& anxiety & tiredness relief, improving sleep, and finally help you to reaching higher energy levels.   Features:  Sturdy Ergonomic seating  Beautiful finish with PU leather  Two cup holders  Adjustable backrest reclines and leg rest can be outstretched for comfortable sit  Leg rests back to the bottom of sofa to save space  8 vibrating massage nodes and different levels of vibrating intensity  Heating therapy and vibrating massage function  Easy-to-use remote control to change massage mode and node rocking design   Specifications:  Color: Brown  Material:  Sturdy PU leather & High-quality sponge padding & Steel base   Package Include:  1 x Massage Chair  1 x Controler  1 X power plug","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LyQofTJlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Globe House Products","source_asin":"B00MOYIBQU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MOYIBQU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MOYIBQU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037587,"name":"Blue Life USA Phos FX 500 mL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711Bm2QZoPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Phos FX Advanced Regenerable Phosphate Removal Resin. Rapid phosphate adsorption, twice as fast as GFO. Cost Effective, can be regenerated 6 times! Highest adsorption capacity. Will not leach, EVER! No clumping or disintegrating. Spherical Beads allow excellent contact time. Long lasting and durable. Use in Freshwater or Marine and Reef Aquariums. Instructions and Guidelines: Phos FX is an exceptional macroporous phosphate removal resin for use in both fresh and saltwater environments. It's high capacity, long lasting beads and easy regeneration make it the most cost effective phosphate removal media on the market. Phos FX has an unparalleled capacity to adsorb phosphates quickly and safely. Don't let your tank fall victim to algae blooms and coral recession. Protect your aquarium with Phos FX! The 500 mL kit will remove 5ppm of phosphates in 500 gallons, 10ppm in 250 gallons. Instructions: Phos FX should be rinsed under purified water for a few seconds before use. It can be used in a canister filter, media reactor, filter box or any high flow area of your sump. Use included media bag and zip tie if not being used in reactor. Use Phos FX in your system until the desired level of phosphates is reached, then remove the bag, rinse and reseal in an airtight container to avoid drying. It is not recommended to lower phosphates more than 0.5ppm in a 24 hour period. For reef tanks a PO4 level between 0.5ppm and 0.08ppm is suggested, however all systems are different and this should be used as a general guide only. Once product has exhausted it can be regenerated six times or more. Regeneration is quick and easy with Blue Life USA's Regen FX to regenerate. Caution: Resin sold moist. Keep closed to prevent drying. Weight varies due to moisture content, product is sold by volume rather than weight. DO NOT LET RESIN DRY OUT! Size: 500 mL","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711Bm2QZoPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Life USA","source_asin":"B00AQK5A7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AQK5A7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AQK5A7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
