window.products.push({"id":1037672,"name":"Launica Industrial Wine Bar Cabinet, Coffee Bar Cabinet for Liquor and Glasses, Modern Metal Wood Liquor Bar Cabinet, Kitchen Sideboard Buffet Cabinet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sj-xj9+gL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional and Practical: Whether you choose to use this in your home bar as a liquor cabinet, dining room as a coffee bar cabinet, kitchen as a sideboard cabinet or hallway as a console table, this wine cabinet will make a practical and stylish addition to your home. Ample Storage Space: With spacious tabletop, one open shelf under the tabletop and three small open shelves in the middle, this modern wine bar cabinet provides you with ample storage space not only to display fruit, coffee machine, tableware, plants, but also to display your 12 favorite wine bottles on the middle shelf. Besides, there are 4 storage compartments behind 2 mesh doors, which can classify and store different items to meet your storage needs Rustic-Chic Style: Balancing clean-lined and rustic elements, our wood and metal buffet cabinet will become a captivating addition to the whole home decor. Plus, two mesh metal doors and unique mesh design on the sides add a touch of high-end and industrial glamour to your room and home. Extraordinary Durability and Sturdy Construction: Crafted of Reinforcement bar under large tabletop and heavy duty metal legs, this dry kitchen rack cabinet boasts robust stability and strength. Meanwhile 1.1” thick chunky wooden tabletop and 2 adjustable supported legs reinforce the design of the farmhouse wine bar cabinet and increase the weight capacity of tabletop to 300 lbs. Easy Assembly and Worry-Free Service: With detailed instruction, numbered parts and all-in tools, it only takes about 40 minutes to assemble this wine bar cabinet. We believe in our rustic buffet cabinet with storage and that's why we back them all with 30-day free return and 24-month quality assurance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sj-xj9+gL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Launica","source_asin":"B0B49NGZKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B49NGZKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B49NGZKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037673,"name":"CONQUECO Manual Coffee Grinder - Hand Bean Grinder with Adjustable Settings, Stainless Steel, 30g Capacity for Drip Coffee, Espresso, French Press","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i4hM2PuZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ENJOY A DELICIOUS CUP OF FRESH COFFEE】The Manual Coffee Grinder by CONQUECO has a built-in adjustable stainless steel conical burr with 28 grids to ensure you have 100% precision & control over the coarseness of your grind. This hand coffee grinder is great for all brewing methods by burr size 38 mm-efficient grinding of coffee beans. 【ROUGHNESS ADJUSTMENT FUNCTION】Built-in an adjustable grind Selector with 28 click settings ensures you have 100% precise control over the coarseness of your different grinding needs every time! Smell the fresh aroma of fresh ground coffee as you brew them on your espresso machine, AeroPress, French Press or pour over coffee maker! 【CONVENIENT TO CARRY AND CLEAN DESIGN】The espresso grinder weighs 579g, while maintaining a lightweight and a moderate sense of weight and luxury. The aluminium alloy surface will avoid ground coffee sticking, a small brush is enough to clean it up. It is ideal not only for home use but also for carrying outdoors or traveling. 【EXQUISITE COFFEE BEEN GRINDER】The hand crank coffee grinder mechanism eliminates over 90% of the noise that electric coffee bean grinders produce.Let you add joy and fun in the process of making coffee when you are on the journey. 【PRODUCT GUARANTEES】The burr coffee grinder shall be calibrated and fixed in place before shipment to ensure that there will be no shaking parts or burrs loose as time goes by. Generally, it is estimated that the grinding is about 100-200KG. Including a one-year limited warranty, you will definitely get 100% customer support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i4hM2PuZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CONQUECO","source_asin":"B0C5LH57R7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5LH57R7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5LH57R7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
