window.products.push({"id":1037694,"name":"Funny Wine Glasses Unique Gifts: I Just Rescued Some Wine. It was in a Bottle, 18.5 oz Large Glass in Gift Box, Great Birthday or Christmas Gifts for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81otqLFpkPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wine Accents wine accessories bring you fun and gorgeous gifts for people who like wine. READY-TO-GIFT Finding original gift ideas is tough enough. We want to make the whole gift giving experience easier for you. You can ship your gift directly from Amazon to the gift recipient and have it arrive as if you wrapped it yourself. The hand-tied ribbon around the gift wrap printed box is perfect for any gift-giving occasion. It's elegant enough to make a great wedding gift and fun enough to be just right for your best friend, man or woman. Just find the perfect slogan from our product line and you will have the perfect fun and unique gift. HIGH QUALITY WINE GLASS Most novelty glass sellers use cheap glasses you would find at a diner - no fun for drinking a nice glass of wine. We want your gift receiver to have a great experience with each sip of wine throughout their lifetime. Our fine crystal glass is large-sized with a long stem and thin cut rim that makes drinking a pleasure, whether it's an Opus One or a Two Buck Chuck. CLEVER SAYINGS AND DESIGN Express your humor or your admiration - either way your gift receiver will remember you fondly everytime they have a glass of wine. We are continuously adding to our gift line, so check back to see what new fun gifts you can surprise your friends and family with.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81otqLFpkPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wine Accents","source_asin":"B0759NDCTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0759NDCTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0759NDCTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037695,"name":"HydroGen Ice Box 8 Inch Water-Cooled Heat Exchanger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rEaIP5lnL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Ice Box is a safe and effective way to water-cool the air leaving your reflectors without adding air-conditioning or more fans. It uses an air-to-water heat exchanger to water cool the hot air your reflectors produce. Water-cooling is much more effective and efficient than air-cooling. Only 30% of the energy used in air conditioning is converted into usable cooling power, the rest is wasted. It doesn't take a rocket scientist to figure out that water-cooling will reduce your electric bill, making your grow room a much happier place for you and your plants. In addition to cooling the heat from all those miniature suns we have in our grow rooms, if the water running through the Ice Box is cold enough, it can actually add supplemental air conditioning to your room, making them great for every operation from hut to warehouse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rEaIP5lnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYDROGEN","source_asin":"B002KLTKXA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002KLTKXA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002KLTKXA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
