window.products.push({"id":1037726,"name":"Foedo Tea Kettle, 102 OZ / 3 Liter Tea Pots for Stove Top with Wood Pattern Handle, Food Grade Stainless Steel Whistling Tea Kettle Stovetop-Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dzGBgstoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Parameters 1. Material: Food grade stainless steel tea kettle body, wood grain rubber handle.  2. Capacity: 3.2 Quart (3L)  3. Dimensions: ①Total width: 7.87\"(200mm) ②Total height: 9.06\"(230mm) ③Teapot depth: 5.71\"(145mm) ④Bottom diameter: 7.68\"(195mm) ⑤Pouring spout diameter: 1.18\"(30mm) ) ⑥The diameter of the top and the mouth of the kettle: 3.94\"(100mm)  4. Color: black  Product Features  1. With whistle function, safety alarm, whistle when the water boils. 2. It has a wide range of applicability and can be used in induction cookers, gas stoves, electric ceramic stoves, halogen stoves, wood stoves and other stoves. 3. Anti-scalding silicone handle, cool touch. 4. Good heating performance and high toughness. 5. One-button switch lid, safe and easy. 6. Large capacity, 3.2 Quart, heating more water in less time, reducing the problem of repeated boiling water.  7. Available in many places, it can be used in various places such as home, office, dormitory and apartment.  Maintenance Tips  How to better maintain your kettle?  1. Boil the water and pour it out 2-3 times before use.  2. Avoid adding too much water, otherwise the whistle will not sound. Under normal circumstances, the amount of water added should not exceed 80%.  3. Let the flame burn at the bottom of the teapot to avoid excessive flames.  4. It is recommended to clean the teapot regularly to avoid limescale and keep the teapot cleaning experience better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dzGBgstoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foedo","source_asin":"B0BG4FLXPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG4FLXPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG4FLXPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
