window.products.push({"id":1037752,"name":"The Vine Square Round Ottoman – Stool Foot Rest Seat Footrest Firm Boucle Cushion Living Room Bedroom Modern Decorative Furniture 5077W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vxAEcTLqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BOUCLE FABRIC OTTOMAN – A contemporary designed round ottoman like this is a must-have in every household. Our ottoman stands out in a sea of lines and angles. The firm boucle cushion is thickly seamed around the top edge, resting in a tubular powder-coated metal frame with statement-making legs. This footrest stool is durable to hold weight to last you a long time. The design is a great overall accent to any living space and provides the sturdy support you need while elevating your home decor. DURABLE QUALITY – Made with soft fabric and accented with metallic stainless steel, this ottoman adds a modern touch to any room. It is affordable yet just as reliable in durability and beautiful as high end luxury furniture. It is also very stable, and as these seating benches need to be able to hold a good amount of weight, this stability is especially essential. These stylish ottomans come in white boucle fabric with a metallic black Iron base that will blend into any setting. MODERN DESIGN – Brighten up your home with this lovely ottoman. It features a classy contemporary minimalism design to suit the modern home’s interior décor. Simple yet stylish, affordable yet luxurious, these ottoman seats will fit into your homes aesthetic easily and will not stick out unpleasantly. The padded cushion looks chic while being comfortable to sit on. Ideal for indoor use, it’s the perfect couch side bench for practical daily use with convenience and style. CONVENIENT SEATING – Great for everyday use in your home, these comfy ottomans can be used in the living room, kitchen, bedroom, closet, doorway, crafting workshop, or office workspace. It is compact and sleek in size, so it doesn’t take up too much space while providing seating space for you or a guest to sit on. Get one or more of these to place by the front door for putting shoes on, in the living area as a complimentary seat next to a sofa, or in the bedroom by a vanity table. MULTIPURPOSE – These ottomans are versatile as you can use them in your bedroom as a vanity bench or bedside table, in a craft room as an extra seat, or in your living space as additional seating or as a foot rest. With the elegant modern design, this furniture piece can also be used decoratively in your living rooms. Buy one or multiple to use around the house. We hope you enjoy The Vine Square products. However if you experience any issues, please feel free to reach out and we can assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vxAEcTLqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Vine Square","source_asin":"B09L59MV8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L59MV8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L59MV8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1037753,"name":"AIRPLUS Humidifier, Powerful Humidifier for Bedroom Lasting up to 60 Hours, Top-Refilling Cool Mist Humidifier with A Water Tank of 4.5L(USAP1988)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D9w7UcVGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top Filling Design: Different from traditional humidifier for babies, AIRPLUS humidifier for home supports adding water directly from above. You don't have to move the air humidifier around. One touch button design coupled with a transparent water tank makes the baby humidifier smart enough to use. Humanized design, convenient using experience. Adjustable Mist Levels: Three mist levels design meets the 360° nozzle and quiet operation, an excellent combination for quality service. The powerful mist output is up to 220 ml / h. It is worth mentioning that cool mist humidifier for bedroom on a full tank can continuously humidify for up to 60 hours without adding water in rooms no more than 450 square feet. When you work or sleep, it will accompany you without disturbance. Essential Oil Available: Pull out the tray on the bottom of the dehumidifier and then add whatever essential oil you like to the cotton pad. The high-frequency vibration will make the water mist more even and delicate. Just immerse yourself in the pleasant fragrance pervading the room, getting rid of the fatigue of the day. Intelligent Shut - off: This humidifier for bedroom will automatically shut off when you remove the water tank or when there is insufficient water. You can totally free from worry about the situation that the bedroom humidifier will dry running when you are sleeping. The automatic shut-off design always reassure you. The light creates a warm atmosphere, a perfect baby humidifier for nursery. Easy Cleaning: Large caliber design and simple structure make thorough cleaning easier. The water tank of the cool mist humidifier for baby can be taken out separately and washed with water directly. The rounded edge prevents you from hurting hands. Besides convenience, we also consider the safety when you clean the tank.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D9w7UcVGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIRPLUS","source_asin":"B0B82DBZ8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1037753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B82DBZ8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B82DBZ8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
